<title>UK: Hague confirms he wants to lead UK Conservatives.</title>
<headline>Hague confirms he wants to lead UK Conservatives.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Welsh secretary William Hague confirmed on Wednesday that he will stand for the leadership of Britain's defeated Conservative Party.</p>
<p>&quot;Yes I am,&quot; he told BBC radio when asked if he was standing.</p>
</text>
